      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Addressing the critics requires framing aid not as charity, but as a shared human responsibility. Remind your audience that when we see suffering anywhere, our shared humanity compels us to respond, regardless of borders. True national strength is measured not just by what we protect at home, but by the compassion and stability we help build in a fragile global community. Therefore, investing in global well-being is an investment in our shared moral future.",
