    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's strong. i love how you framed it as \"strengthening the global human tapestry.\" \n\nso, if i were to ask you—not just for the speech, but just generally—is there ever a valid point to the argument that we should stop foreign aid and focus strictly on our own country? or is that argument just fundamentally flawed from a moral and logical standpoint?",
